; --- INTRO ---
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.05,0:00:03.13,EN,,0,0,0,,Welcome everyone to day two of my series.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.05,0:00:03.13,ID,,0,0,0,,Selamat datang semua di hari kedua dari series gua.

; --- PEAD part 1 ---
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.26,0:00:07.44,EN,,0,0,0,,Did you know that prices tend to drift for up to sixty days after news?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.26,0:00:07.44,ID,,0,0,0,,Tahukah kamu bahwa harga bisa drift sampai enam puluh hari setelah news?

; --- PEAD part 2 ---
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.98,0:00:12.96,EN,,0,0,0,,This is what's called PEAD, Post Earnings Announcement Drift.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.98,0:00:12.96,ID,,0,0,0,,Inilah apa yang disebut sebagai PEAD atau Post Earning Announcement Drift.

; --- ANALYST_A ---
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.09,0:00:18.03,EN,,0,0,0,,Not only that, if analysts upgrade their sentiment on this stock,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.09,0:00:18.03,ID,,0,0,0,,Bukan hanya itu, jika para analis mengupgrade sentimen stok ini,

; --- ANALYST_B part 1 ---
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.16,0:00:22.26,EN,,0,0,0,,the stock price can rise or fall for weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.16,0:00:22.26,ID,,0,0,0,,Akibatnya, harga stok ini bisa naik atau turun selama beberapa minggu.

; --- ANALYST_B part 2 ---
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.70,0:00:25.58,EN,,0,0,0,,This is called analyst-driven momentum.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.70,0:00:25.58,ID,,0,0,0,,Inilah yang disebut sebagai analyst driven momentum.

; --- MERGER_A part 1 ---
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.71,0:00:27.49,EN,,0,0,0,,Now, imagine this:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.71,0:00:27.49,ID,,0,0,0,,Nah, gue mau lu bayangin, ya.

; --- MERGER_A part 2 ---
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.89,0:00:31.91,EN,,0,0,0,,Company A announces they'll buy Company B shares
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.89,0:00:31.91,ID,,0,0,0,,Misalnya, perusahaan A bilang bahwa berapa bulan kedatangan ini,

; --- MERGER_A part 3 ---
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.23,0:00:35.93,EN,,0,0,0,,for $30 per share.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.23,0:00:35.93,ID,,0,0,0,,mereka mau beli share perusahaan B dengan harga tiga puluh dolar per share.

; --- MERGER_B part 1 ---
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.06,0:00:41.24,EN,,0,0,0,,If we buy those shares at $28 per share right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.06,0:00:41.24,ID,,0,0,0,,Jika kita beli share itu dengan harga dua puluh delapan dolar per share sekarang ini,

; --- MERGER_B part 2 ---
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.28,0:00:44.42,EN,,0,0,0,,we're guaranteed $2 profit per share.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.28,0:00:44.42,ID,,0,0,0,,maka kita garanti dua dolar profit per share.

; --- MERGER_B part 3 ---
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.48,0:00:46.72,EN,,0,0,0,,This is merger arbitrage.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.48,0:00:46.72,ID,,0,0,0,,Inilah yang disebut sebagai merger arbitrage.

; --- FDA_A part 1 ---
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.85,0:00:49.63,EN,,0,0,0,,Biotech companies in the US
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.85,0:00:49.63,ID,,0,0,0,,Biasanya perusahaan bioteknologi di Amerika

; --- FDA_A part 2 ---
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.97,0:00:55.91,EN,,0,0,0,,need FDA approval with a PDUFA date published months in advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.97,0:00:55.91,ID,,0,0,0,,butuh persetujuan dari FDA dan PDUFA yang dipublisikan beberapa bulan sebelum kejadian.

; --- FDA_B part 1 ---
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.04,0:00:59.44,EN,,0,0,0,,In that window, the stock can rise 20%,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.04,0:00:59.44,ID,,0,0,0,,Dalam jangka waktu itu, stok bisa naik dua puluh persen,

; --- FDA_B part 2 ---
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.80,0:01:02.26,EN,,0,0,0,,four to eight weeks before the announcement.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.80,0:01:02.26,ID,,0,0,0,,empat sampai delapan minggu sebelum announcement.

; --- FDA_C part 1 ---
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.39,0:01:07.13,EN,,0,0,0,,As traders, we just buy the stock when it's published,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.39,0:01:07.13,ID,,0,0,0,,Nah, kita sebagai trader tinggal beli stok ini waktu baru dipublikasikan,

; --- FDA_C part 2 ---
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.17,0:01:11.00,EN,,0,0,0,,and sell before the announcement, to stay safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.17,0:01:11.00,ID,,0,0,0,,dan jual sebelum announcement itu keluar, biar kita bisa aman.

; --- RECAP ---
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.13,0:01:16.99,EN,,0,0,0,,In this video we covered four trading techniques used after news drops.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.13,0:01:16.99,ID,,0,0,0,,Dalam video ini kita sudah bahas empat trading teknik yang dipakai setelah news keluar.

; --- TEASE part 1 ---
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.12,0:01:19.58,EN,,0,0,0,,In the next video, we'll find out
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.12,0:01:19.58,ID,,0,0,0,,Di video selanjutnya, kita akan cari tahu

; --- TEASE part 2 ---
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.70,0:01:21.96,EN,,0,0,0,,if there are techniques to predict
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.70,0:01:21.96,ID,,0,0,0,,jika ada teknik-teknik yang bisa dipakai

; --- TEASE part 3 ---
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.26,0:01:25.26,EN,,0,0,0,,the outcome before news comes out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.26,0:01:25.26,ID,,0,0,0,,untuk mencari tahu hasilnya sebelum news keluar.

; --- OUTRO CTA part 1 ---
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.39,0:01:28.63,EN,,0,0,0,,Once again, if you're into algorithmic trading,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.39,0:01:28.63,ID,,0,0,0,,Once again, jika kalian tertarik dengan algorithmic trading,

; --- OUTRO CTA part 2 ---
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.97,0:01:31.61,EN,,0,0,0,,like, follow, and comment on my IG.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.97,0:01:31.61,ID,,0,0,0,,tinggal like, follow, dan comment di IG gua.

; --- OUTRO farewell ---
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.15,0:01:33.13,EN,,0,0,0,,See you next time!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.15,0:01:33.13,ID,,0,0,0,,Sampai jumpa lagi!

; --- OUTRO peace ---
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.65,0:01:34.20,EN,,0,0,0,,Peace!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.65,0:01:34.20,ID,,0,0,0,,Peace!
